# render_pass_msaa: MSAA: a 4-sample memoryless colour attachment resolved into a texture over a shared buffer (store MultisampleResolve), a triangle whose edges cross pixels; then the same with 0x20 SetProgrammableSamplePositions, which moves the edge pixels' coverage; then store StoreAndMultisampleResolve, which the memoryless rule turns into DontCare, so nothing is resolved. Count 9 throws; a count longer than its points fails to read. Last, 8 positions (the most the decoder takes) on a 4-sample pass: Metal aborts, and the host dies in every setup, an isolated task's included. host: the default sample positions are the GPU's.
